Package: ubs-engine-client-libs
Section: libs
Architecture: arm64
Depends: libboundscheck, libstdc++6, ${shlibs:Depends}, ${misc:Depends}
Description: UBSE client shared library for third-party integration
 UBSE client shared library (libubse-client.so.1) for third-party
 applications to access UBSE services.
 This package contains the runtime shared library required by programs
 that dynamically link to UBSE.

Package: ubs-engine-client-dev
Section: libdevel
Architecture: arm64
Depends: ubs-engine-client-libs (= ${binary:Version}), ${misc:Depends}
Description: Development package for UBSE client SDK
 Header files and static libraries for developing applications that use
 the UBSE client SDK.
 This package is required for compiling programs that link against UBSE.

